        <mxCell id="XaGGuLg5vc8r4vhpNRoa-7" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;ul class=&quot;XSq4R KI3fJ&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 245, 246);&quot;&gt;OnEnable&lt;/code&gt; 是唯一一个在“脚本启用时”就会调用的函数&lt;/span&gt;（并且每次脚本或所在游戏对象从关闭变为开启、或者从对象池取出时，都会被再次调用）。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px 0px 12px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 245, 246);&quot;&gt;Awake&lt;/code&gt; 不是在脚本启用时调用的&lt;/span&gt;，而是在&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;对象被初始化/载入时&lt;/span&gt;（或者实例化预制件后）立即调用一次。即使脚本本身处于 &lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 245, 246);&quot;&gt;enabled = false&lt;/code&gt; 状态，只要所在的游戏对象（GameObject）是激活的，&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 245, 246);&quot;&gt;Awake&lt;/code&gt; 就会执行。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;code dir=&quot;ltr&quot; class=&quot;KDcb0c&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(243, 245, 246);&quot;&gt;Start&lt;/code&gt; 也不只取决于脚本启用&lt;/span&gt;，它是在&lt;span class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;脚本启用后的第一帧 Update 之前&lt;/span&gt;调用一次（且整个生命周期只执行一次）。&lt;/span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.unity3d.com/cn/2019.4/Manual/ExecutionOrder.html&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1962629406137770323&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://cn.linkedin.com/pulse/unity-life-cycle-initialization-mercury-finnegan?tl=zh&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.csdn.net/weixin_44335322/article/details/136740078&quot;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://juejin.cn/post/7054310054073204744&quot;&gt;5&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://yi1.cn/notes/lifecycle.html&quot;&gt;6&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="900" x="130" y="860" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XaGGuLg5vc8r4vhpNRoa-8" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;ConfirmEnhance: pass weapon uid and total exp to controller; pass material uid and count numbers to controller. Reset total exp, material-count pairs and regenerate each material view.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;monospace&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ojrtQ&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 134, 139);&quot;&gt;// Reset each meaterial count to 0.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;uiJ0Tc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(147, 52, 230);&quot;&gt;foreach&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt; (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;uiJ0Tc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(147, 52, 230);&quot;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt; key &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;uiJ0Tc&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(147, 52, 230);&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt; dict.Keys.ToList()) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ojrtQ&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(128, 134, 139);&quot;&gt;// Use .ToList() to avoid modifying a collection while &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;iterating over it, as this can trigger an exception.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;{&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;dict[key] = &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;N1kUHb&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(180, 89, 8);&quot;&gt;0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;undefined&quot; style=&quot;font-family: monospace; font-size: 14px; margin: 0px; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="770" x="750" y="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
